--[[
	RarityConfig  (ModuleScript)
	Put in: ReplicatedStorage > Items > Modules > RarityConfig

	Colors, roll weights and display odds for the five rarities.
	  color            frame/text color (icons in items/icons use the same colors)
	  weight           base roll weight. Bigger = more common. Odds = weight / sum of weights
	  luckExponent     how much luck boosts this rarity: weight * (1 + luck) ^ luckExponent
	  baseOddsPercent  % chance per cast with 0 luck (for UI only; LootRoller does the real math)
	  stars            star count shown on icons
	  glow             suggestion: add a ParticleEmitter/PointLight to Legendary and Mythic fish

	GENERATED by tools/items/gen_luau.py from tools/items/item_data.py.
	To change numbers, edit item_data.py and re-run the generator (or edit here and keep both in sync).
]]

